Category: boot
Check: check_lilo
Fix: chmod 600 /etc/lilo.conf, owned by root.
References: lilo.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The LILO configuration file is readable by its group. It can hold the
boot password in clear text and should be 0600 and owned by root.
